<title>CHINA: SGA sets warrants on basket of property stocks.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on basket of property stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA, Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Thursday it had launched 400 million American style call warrants on a basket of property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd		0.025 shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd   0.025 shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	   0.02  shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	  0.035 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$7.54     PREMIUM	 13.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1460   GEARING	 5.43X</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG   PAYDATE	 19.AUG.97</p>
<p> MATURITY	   31.MAY.98   LISTING DATE  21.AUG.97</p>
<p> EXER. LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>			ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
